    <string name="setup_title">Become Device Owner</string>
    <string name="setup_instructions">There must be no other device owner or accounts on the device.\n\nOn a computer with ADB:\n\nadb shell dpm set-device-owner com.example.deviceownerapp/.DeviceAdmin\n\nIf that fails, first uninstall any accounts and other device-admin apps, then try again.\n\nAlternative: install Dhizuku, grant it Device Owner via the same adb command for its package, then return here and press Connect Dhizuku.</string>

